  "extraction_notes": [
    "The supplied ordering code IRF630NPBF corresponds to the datasheet marking IRF630NPbF, the TO-220AB variant; the same sheet also covers IRF630NSPbF and IRF630NLPbF package variants with common electrical data.",
    "The PDF is an International Rectifier sheet (PD-95047A, dated 07/23/10); the requested manufacturer field is retained as Infineon Technologies.",
    "The device is an n-channel MOSFET. Datasheet polarity and all plotted curves use positive VGS, VDS, ID, and source-drain forward-voltage magnitudes.",
    "RDS(on) has only a MAX specification, at VGS = 10 V and ID = 5.4 A. VGS(th) has MIN and MAX only, with no typical column.",
    "Ciss, Coss, and Crss are typical table values at VGS = 0 V, VDS = 25 V, and f = 1 MHz. The capacitance-versus-VDS figure is a typical plot with logarithmic VDS and linear capacitance axes.",
    "Fig. 1 output curves and Fig. 3 transfer curve were digitized from the TJ = 25 degC traces. Fig. 2 and the TJ = 175 degC transfer trace were not included because the extraction target is the 25 degC condition.",
    "The plotted points are manual reads from the datasheet traces and are approximate digitizations, not interpolated table values."
  ],
